          "fix": "After the ContentstackLivePreviewProvider is in place (attachment point #1), this line automatically receives updated preview content because it reads from the same context. If server-side content fetching needs to include live_preview hash parameters, add a helper that reads the preview hash from the URL (provided by @contentstack/live-preview-utils) and passes it through the context so getStaticProps/getServerSideProps can include it in Contentstack SDK queries.",
